                            <comment id="16096104" author="avolkov" created="Fri, 21 Jul 2017 10:19:44 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Retested for ver. 2.1.0#20170720-sha1:a6ca5c8a. Node deactivation works fine. &lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;This scenario was tested:&lt;br/&gt;
1. start node with enabled persistent store in config file.&lt;br/&gt;
2. activate cluster.&lt;br/&gt;
3. check that cluster is activated.&lt;br/&gt;
4. deactivate cluster.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;From attached log I see that some caches were started. Please provide config file which was used and clarify the scenario.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
